entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uLXQls4seI8Q7kNvwEob53O&_nc_oc=AdoP2PFx4NsEm9Axr1SXem-YGx1rI0-4IZGzrJXTgmdKtbrzWzN6ydXplqsMo9f0_gc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT7Dpm71wCvNCN5QEhC3zDXQ6RzePk_Wxnfsrt3KmlSdQ&oe=6B01E46F"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zjcG6t5QaTUQ7kNvwE31fVw&_nc_oc=Adpgjn1lJMx_q01NEznotVo7XJXOAtmYb17XBRm7EbDstUnWgGRaAuHvSUxHMFzKr_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSGYKgh02w7v_pGerUL55ZYKjCN7FVWvjLqhT_ZagcpjA&oe=6B01CAAD"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MA6dqIq0YIYQ7kNvwHoVUC4&_nc_oc=AdqIcM0Nu2C96ZWIP7OSm3lC3gsrjdv6NLIFN8t3Xz0AZPmSMJ3zKSqieIcoj0HFFnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWCDvL6cyPpaaNwJ0wZ4aq46Pu8kXvd3BCqs8we355nA&oe=6B01C2B9"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49